        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 400; margin-top: var(--space-8); margin-bottom: var(--space-4); color: var(--color-text);">Contact</h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: var(--space-8);">To exercise your rights or if you have questions regarding personal data processing, please contact us by email at: <a href="mailto:sale@byelmarie.com">sale@byelmarie.com</a> or in writing to the Controller's address.</p>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 400; margin-top: var(--space-10); margin-bottom: var(--space-4); color: var(--color-text);">Cookies</h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">To improve the provided services, our website uses cookies. Cookies are small files that store information in your browser and are commonly used to distinguish individual users. Pixels are small images or "pieces of code" located on a website or in an email that collect information about your browser or mobile device, some of which may also store cookies. Individual users are not identifiable based on this information.</p>
        <p style="margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">Individual cookies have varying retention periods on your device. Some cookies are deleted from your device after you close the browser window (session cookies), while others remain stored on your device even after you finish browsing our website (persistent cookies).</p>

        <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 500; margin-top: var(--space-6); margin-bottom: var(--space-3); color: var(--color-text);">Why Do We Use Cookies?</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">Cookies allow us to remember your actions and preferences (such as login details, shopping cart items) over a certain period of time, so you do not have to re-enter them during your next visit. Cookies also help us understand what interests you on our site, whether it is clear enough, and if you can find what you are looking for. Thus, we use cookies to improve user experience.</p>
        <p style="margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">Cookies may also record other information, such as the number of visitors to our website, or which subpages of our site you visit most frequently. They are also used to display advertisements and site content relevant to your interests and needs.</p>

        <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 500; margin-top: var(--space-6); margin-bottom: var(--space-3); color: var(--color-text);">What Cookies Do We Use?</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">The following types of cookies may be used on our website:</p>
        <ol style="margin-left: var(--space-6); margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
          <li style="margin-bottom: var(--space-3);"><b>Functional and Technical Cookies</b> – these cookies ensure the proper operation of our website, such as logging into the user section, saving items to the shopping cart, detecting unauthorized login attempts, or securing form submissions. Without these cookies, our website would not function correctly, and their use is necessary; therefore, we do not require your consent to store and access them. This category also includes cookies that keep your cart items saved without logging in.</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom: var(--space-3);"><b>Analytical Cookies</b> – these cookies serve to obtain data on website traffic, search queries, and to analyze how you navigate our site so that we can make it as easy to use as possible. Because we have taken measures to prevent their misuse (anonymization on our suppliers' end) and have implemented options for you to easily control and limit their use, we do not require your consent for their use.</li>
